"""External selected-module focal; SOURCE preparation until Root assigns CPU.

One real pytest invocation collects before fixtures and records call reports.
There is no receipt-only mode, test retry, installer, provider or deployment.
Network/import observations are Python process snapshots, not a kernel or
transitive-child attestation. Management timeout is not a product waiver.
"""
